The download/install process now includes security/software coordination rather than the older direct-download approach.

The session referred to an AMD software download location; verify that the shared folder/location exists and is accessible before giving the location to the security team.

Windows and Linux use different installation commands. Linux may additionally require PAD assistance/access as described during the meeting.

